onvey brand vision and interact with potential buyers. Content writing and copywriting courses can help you hone your storytelling and writing skills. You will learn to write different types of content for varied platforms, including on-page, off-page, guest posts, blogs, social media, and more. This is one of the best professional courses after 12th commerce that even freelancers and business owners can opt for.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>A well-structured content writing curriculum covers the following topics:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Basics of content writing and copywriting<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Plagiarism<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Social media content writing<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Writing ad copies<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Elements of a great copy<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Fundamentals of editing<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Article and blog writing<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Email writing<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>SEO<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Content marketing<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Keyword research<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Average Course Fee- <\/strong>INR 15,000 or more<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Course Duration- <\/strong>3-6 months<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Career Prospects<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Content writer<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Copywriter<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Content editor<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Content strategist<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>SEO specialist<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Proofreader<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Content marketer<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Content lead<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">11. DevOps<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>DevOps engineers use real-time data to evaluate and reflect on the performance of a system. This allows them to resolve the issues at the earliest without hiring or involving a separate troubleshooting team. DevOps has gained immense popularity over the years and is evolving continuously. There are already hundreds of DevOps jobs, and the numbers will only rise in the coming years, offering more opportunities to DevOps professionals.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>DevOps experts are some of the most highly paid-IT experts. So, if you also want a lucrative career, this is surely one of the top professional courses to after 12th PCM. Once certified, you can explore different job roles worldwide across different industries.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>The key topics you will learn during the training are:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Infrastructure setup<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Introduction to DevOps<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>HDFS Architecture<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Continuous testing<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>DevOps on Cloud<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Continuous integration using Jenkins<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>5 Daemons of Hadoop Replication in Hadoop<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Hadoop Cluster Setup<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Software version control<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Fail Over Mechanism<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>JDK Installation<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Continuous deployment: Containerization with Docker<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Containerization with Docker: Ecosystem and networking<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Configuration management using Puppet<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Configuration management using Ansible<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Continuous orchestration using Kubernetes<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Continuous monitoring using Nagios<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Terraform modules and workspaces<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Average Course Fee- <\/strong>INR 28,000 or more<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Course Duration- <\/strong>6 &#8211; 9 months<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Career Prospects<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>DevOps Architect<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Release Manager<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Security Engineer<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>DevOps Cloud Engineer<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>DevOps Automation Expert<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Software Tester<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Integration Specialist<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">12. <strong>Search Engine Optimization<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Search Engine Optimization (SEO) is a digital marketing technique to optimize a website and improve its ranking on a search engine result page (SERP), such as Google, Yahoo, etc. Brands use SEO techniques to reach a wide audience and generate more quality traffic.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>As more and more businesses are launching their websites to connect with their potential customers, SEO skills can lead to a great career ahead. It is a booming industry with ample job vacancies in startups, small businesses, and large enterprises. If you are looking for the best professional courses after 12th, SEO can be the right pick for you.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>In this course, you will learn about different SEO techniques, including on-page, off-page, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/local-seo-ranking-factors\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">local SEO<\/a>, and more. You will also know the difference between organic traffic and paid SEO. As you work on different projects during training, you will gain efficiency in the following topics:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Basics of SEO<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>WordPress<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Keyword Research<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>On-Page SEO<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Technical SEO<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Off-Page SEO<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Using SEO Tools<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Understanding The SERP<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Google Processing<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Google Search Console<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Google Analytics<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Average Course Fee- <\/strong>INR 15,000 or more<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Course Duration- <\/strong>2- 4 months<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Career Prospects<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>SEO executive<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Digital marketer<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>PPC expert<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Social media marketer<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Content strategist<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Website content writer<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>E-commerce SEO specialist<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Technical SEO expert<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>SEO data analyst<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">13. <strong>Graphic Designing<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"699\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/Graphic-Designing.webp\" alt=\"Graphic Designing - Best professional course after 12th\" class=\"wp-image-4606\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/Graphic-Designing.webp 1000w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/Graphic-Designing-300x210.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/Graphic-Designing-768x537.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Graphic designing involves creating and composing designs using visual elements. It can be to create a magazine cover, brand logo, poster, product packaging, social media posts, website, mobile app, or any other platform. If you look around, you will find some sort of graphic design in almost everything, whether a Netflix movie poster, online shopping app, shopping bag, blogging website, logo, etc. So, creating any visual content means practicing graphic design.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>With businesses moving online and embracing digital platforms, such as social media, YouTube, websites, and other platforms, demand for graphic designers is also rising. Companies need skilled and innovative designers to create visually appealing and unique designs for their brands. They need someone who can come up with out-of-the-box ideas for their brochures, business cards, thumbnails, ads, presentations, logos, pamphlets, and posters and convey their brand vision through images or graphics.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>So, it\u2019s a great time to learn graphic design through a job-oriented professional course. Even if you don\u2019t have any experience in design, you can enroll in the course and learn this art from the ground up. Through extensive training, you can hone your skills and knowledge and get career-ready within a few months. You can choose to work for one company or work as a freelancer for different clients.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>A graphic design course includes the following topics:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Introduction to Graphic Design<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Adobe Illustrator Advanced<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Color Theory<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Typography&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Basics of Adobe Photoshop<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Branding an Identity Design<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Adobe Photoshop Advanced<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Adobe InDesign (Basic to Advanced)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>CorelDRAW<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Art &amp; Visual Perception<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Assignments &amp; Projects<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Vector Graphics for Designers<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Average Course Fee- <\/strong>INR 20,000<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Course Duration- <\/strong>3-5 months<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Career Prospects<\/strong><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Web designer<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Graphic designer&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Illustrator<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>User experience designer<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Art director<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Animator<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Creative director<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">14. Ethical Hacking<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/ethical-hacking\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Ethical hacking<\/a> is an authorized practice of breaking into a computer or network of an organization to detect vulnerabilities in the system. It aims at identifying potential data breaches and threats in a network. Professional ethical hackers are responsible for investigating a network to find weak points that hackers with malicious motives can exploit. They improve security footprints to withstand attacks or divert them.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Ethical hacking is another professional course popular among graduates as it ensures a secure career and a wide range of job options. It equips learners with the latest hacking methodologies, skills, and techniques required to become job-ready. Even if you are not from a technical background or possess prior experience in cybersecurity, you can take this course as it covers each technical aspect from scratch.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>You will get to learn from industry experts, who will train you to prevent black hat hackers from compromising systems, devices, and networks and avoid cyberattacks and data breaches. You will also master several advanced topics, including social engineering, sniffing, DoS\/DDoS attacks, attack vectors, enumeration, and more. Here\u2019s a detailed list of all topics covered in a comprehensive <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/ethical-hacking-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=BlogInterlink&amp;utm_campaign=traffic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">ethical hacking course<\/a>:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Introduction To Ethical Hacking<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Setting Up Ethical Hacking Lab<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Footprinting And Reconnaissance<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Scanning Networks (Ping, Nmap, Zenmap, Messcan, Armitage, Hping3)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Enumeration<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Vulnerability Assessment<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Being Anonymous<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>System Hacking<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Malware Threats<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Sniffing<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Social Engineering<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>DoS &amp; DDoS Attacks<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Session Hijacking<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Hacking Web Servers &amp; Web Apps<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Hacking Wireless Networks<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Hacking Mobile Platform<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Cryptography<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>System Security Using Firewall, WAF And Antivirus<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Job Assistance And Career Counselling<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Average Course Fee- <\/strong>INR 25,000 or more<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Course Duration- <\/strong>3-6 months<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Career Prospects<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Data Security Specialist<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Vulnerability Assessor<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Cybersecurity Expert<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Security Consultant<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Web Security Manager<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Penetration Tester<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Security Auditor<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Network Security Administrator<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Security Engineer\/Architect<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Applications Security Executive<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Information Security Analyst<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Information Security Manager<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Certified Ethical Hacker (CEH)<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">15. <strong>Cloud Computing<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"666\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/cloud-computing-1.webp\" alt=\"cloud computing - professional course after 12th in India\" class=\"wp-image-4608\" style=\"width:944px;height:629px\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/cloud-computing-1.webp 1000w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/cloud-computing-1-300x200.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/cloud-computing-1-768x511.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/cloud-computing-1-900x600.webp 900w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Rather than having their own data centers or dedicated resources, many companies adopt cloud technology. Whether big or small, organizations are adopting cloud computing because of its lower costs and more flexibility than expensive hardware and software. Businesses opt for secure private clouds, low-cost public clouds, or hybrid solutions, depending on their budget and requirements.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>With a surge in demand for cloud computing, students are pursuing training in the field and joining short-term courses. This is undoubtedly one of the in-demand professional courses after 12th computer science that equips learners with skills and knowledge of significant cloud computing concepts and their implementation in real life. The curriculum includes everything from software-as-as-service (SaaS) and software applications to platform-as-a-service (PaaS) and infrastructure-as-a-service (IaaS) for end-to-end business solutions.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Students will also learn about cloud hosting service providers, their architecture, deployment, and more to address different business infrastructure issues. Once the training is done, you will receive not only an industry-recognized certificate but also certifications from various vendors, including Google Cloud, Amazon Web Services, IBM Cloud, and Microsoft Azure.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>As a student undergoing a cloud computing course, you will gain a fair knowledge of&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Computing and Cloud Computing: History<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Foundation of Cloud<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Impact of Cloud Computing<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Cloud Computing Solution Architectures<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Targeting the right solution architecture<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Data Visualization<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Cloud Ecosystem<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Private Cloud Environment&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Public Cloud Environment<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Technology engineering of Cloud Computing<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Cloud service life cycle<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Cloud Security and Migration<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Types of XaaS solutions<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Service transition and service transformation<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>IaaS cloud<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>SaaS cloud<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>PaaS cloud<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Average Course Fee- <\/strong>INR 50,000 or more<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Course Duration- <\/strong>10 months to 1 year<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Career Prospects<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Cloud Architect<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Cloud Ope